5:["$","h2",null,{"children":"From The Roadside To The Community"}]
6:["$","p","Kathi took a chance and began her journey as a businesswoman in the shrimping industry, first in Leesville, Louisiana.",{"children":"Kathi took a chance and began her journey as a businesswoman in the shrimping industry, first in Leesville, Louisiana."}]
7:["$","p","Because Leesville was known for being friendly to peddlers, she commuted there daily to sell her shrimp supply on the side of the road.",{"children":"Because Leesville was known for being friendly to peddlers, she commuted there daily to sell her shrimp supply on the side of the road."}]
8:["$","p","Her bubbly personality, integrity, and genuine love for humanity won her the respect of the public.",{"children":"Her bubbly personality, integrity, and genuine love for humanity won her the respect of the public."}]
9:["$","p","\"Kathi, the Shrimp Lady\" had become a staple in the business community.",{"children":"\"Kathi, the Shrimp Lady\" had become a staple in the business community."}]
a:["$","section","A Family Business Takes Shape",{"className":"story-section ","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-inner","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-content","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-eyebrow","children":"Growing The Business"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"A Family Business Takes Shape"}],[["$","p","As her reputation grew stronger, her business followed suit. She enlisted the support of her brother Billy Bonamici to help manage the overwhelming growth.",{"children":"As her reputation grew stronger, her business followed suit. She enlisted the support of her brother Billy Bonamici to help manage the overwhelming growth."}],["$","p","To supply the demand, they purchased a shrimp dock and purchasing plant in Hackberry, Louisiana.",{"children":"To supply the demand, they purchased a shrimp dock and purchasing plant in Hackberry, Louisiana."}],["$","p","Napoleonic Law and restrictions plagued the growing business, eventually landing her before the Supreme Court. To the delight of the community, she emerged victorious.",{"children":"Napoleonic Law and restrictions plagued the growing business, eventually landing her before the Supreme Court. To the delight of the community, she emerged victorious."}]]]}]}]}]
b:["$","section","Building Steamboat Bill's",{"className":"story-section story-section-alt","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-inner","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-content","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-eyebrow","children":"Kathi & Bill"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Building Steamboat Bill's"}],[["$","p","Years later, William \"Bill\" Vidrine, a local fisherman, joined Kathi in her journey.",{"children":"Years later, William \"Bill\" Vidrine, a local fisherman, joined Kathi in her journey."}],["$","p","Being a leader in the seafood industry, Bill used his experience and knowledge of the business to accelerate the growth of Steamboat Bill's Seafood Market.",{"children":"Being a leader in the seafood industry, Bill used his experience and knowledge of the business to accelerate the growth of Steamboat Bill's Seafood Market."}],["$","p","Later, they opened two Steamboat Bill's locations in Lake Charles, Louisiana — on Lakeshore Drive and Martin Luther King Hwy.",{"children":"Later, they opened two Steamboat Bill's locations in Lake Charles, Louisiana — on Lakeshore Drive and Martin Luther King Hwy."}]]]}]}]}]
c:["$","section","A Roadside Dream That Became A Tradition",{"className":"story-section ","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-inner","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-content","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-eyebrow","children":"The Legacy"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"A Roadside Dream That Became A Tradition"}],[["$","p","Sticking to a firm business model, working long hours, and focusing on delivering a quality product, Kathi and Bill were unknowingly creating a brand that has withstood the test of time.",{"children":"Sticking to a firm business model, working long hours, and focusing on delivering a quality product, Kathi and Bill were unknowingly creating a brand that has withstood the test of time."}],["$","p","The success of Steamboat Bill's is credited to God, our loyal customers, our hard-working staff, the founding family, and most importantly the roadside peddler's dream of Kathi Bonamici Vidrine.",{"children":"The success of Steamboat Bill's is credited to God, our loyal customers, our hard-working staff, the founding family, and most importantly the roadside peddler's dream of Kathi Bonamici Vidrine."}],["$","p","With the support of everyone involved in the journey, Steamboat Bill's has gained the reputation that it maintains in the restaurant industry.",{"children":"With the support of everyone involved in the journey, Steamboat Bill's has gained the reputation that it maintains in the restaurant industry."}],["$","p","With multiple locations emerging throughout the South, the growth of the franchise is being realized. The excitement is overwhelming and the possibilities are endless.",{"children":"With multiple locations emerging throughout the South, the growth of the franchise is being realized. The excitement is overwhelming and the possibilities are endless."}]]]}]}]}]
